        "Two women stand side-by-side on a wooden ship deck under bright daylight; the woman on the left wears a dark brown tricorn hat with a gold skull and crossbones emblem, a red bandana tied around her head, long wavy brown hair partially braided, a white off-the-shoulder blouse with lace detailing, a dark brown corset with gold-colored lacing and metal eyelets, a wide brown belt with ornate brass buckles, and a layered skirt with a black-and-beige diamond pattern, her right hand resting on her hip while her left arm is bent at the elbow with fingers curled; she smiles directly at the camera with visible teeth. The woman on the right has long, straight blonde hair flowing over her shoulders, no clothing except for a small green arrow tattoo on her lower abdomen, standing with her body angled slightly away from the camera, her left hand gripping a thick coiled rope hanging vertically to her right, her right arm bent at the elbow with fingers loosely curled, her gaze directed forward with a neutral expression. Behind them, the ship’s wooden railings, thick ropes, and masts are visible, with the ocean and sky forming a blurred background. The lighting is harsh and direct, casting strong shadows on the deck and the women’s bodies, indicating midday sun. The image is framed as a medium shot, capturing both subjects from the waist up, with a shallow depth of field that blurs the background elements while keeping the women in sharp focus. The overall style is photorealistic, rendered with high detail and texture, resembling a professional studio photograph rather than an illustration or 3D render."
